| Build — compile and link the HostFS module with the DDE.
| Produces <Obey$Dir>.HostFS,ffa.  Obey halts at the first failing
| command, so any error below is the one to read.  The o directory is
| expected to exist already.
Set HostFS$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Dir <Obey$Dir>
cc -c -zM -zps1 -ffah -IC: -o o.hostfs c.hostfs
cmhg cmhg.HostFS -o o.head
link -rmf -o HostFS,ffa o.head o.hostfs C:o.stubs
Echo Built <HostFS$Dir>.HostFS,ffa
